{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Hey Calvin, been ages! Guess what? I got picked for a car mod workshop. Gonna get better at it and learn something new! Look at the cars I'm working with right now."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-50/session_13-42068a6eaab6ef6200307e2c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:21:17.241097+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "42068a6eaab6ef6200307e2c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "42068a6eaab6ef6200307e2c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Wow Dave, that's awesome! Congrats on being picked for the car mod workshop. It's a great opportunity to take your skills up a notch. Are there any mods or projects you're excited to work on?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-50/session_13-f7773b901126dcc21d25c9a2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:21:17.262494+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f7773b901126dcc21d25c9a2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f7773b901126dcc21d25c9a2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Thanks, Calvin! This is a dream come true for me, as I've always wanted to learn auto engineering and work on building a custom car."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-50/session_13-d548fd2e3eab84e9b323ad4c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:21:17.279131+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d548fd2e3eab84e9b323ad4c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d548fd2e3eab84e9b323ad4c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: That's awesome, Dave! Pursuing your passion for auto engineering and making a custom car is a great experience. I'm excited to see what you create. Keep it up and have fun every step of the way. What do you think is the most thrilling part of it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-50/session_13-51df23d565228385e95ee2dd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:21:17.292374+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "51df23d565228385e95ee2dd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "51df23d565228385e95ee2dd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Thanks, Calvin! I've found the picture with really thrilling part of the workshop, take a look. Seeing the potential come to life is always satisfying."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-50/session_13-1938e5b6a4d1dfbe5f0ab7cc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:21:17.304244+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1938e5b6a4d1dfbe5f0ab7cc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1938e5b6a4d1dfbe5f0ab7cc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Wow, that sounds like a fulfilling hobby! What kind of transformations have you done so far? How's it going with the current project?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-50/session_13-9ec5758dc6d91bc2d94be824", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:21:17.318069+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9ec5758dc6d91bc2d94be824", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9ec5758dc6d91bc2d94be824", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: I've been working on this car, doing engine swaps and suspension modifications. Now I'm learning about body modifications. Giving this classic muscle car a modern twist is a challenge but so fun!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-50/session_13-7e3e697c0227beff9483629b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:21:17.331772+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7e3e697c0227beff9483629b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7e3e697c0227beff9483629b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Wow, Dave, that looks cool! The silver finish gives it a modern twist. Great job!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-50/session_13-d0c3156ed53f1d8e9d9b84d5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:21:17.345387+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d0c3156ed53f1d8e9d9b84d5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d0c3156ed53f1d8e9d9b84d5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Thanks, Calvin! Yeah, I wanted a modern vibe but also that classic muscle car style. Really happy with it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-50/session_13-e92d5bc4f5c19e2f5d8159c5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:21:17.358091+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e92d5bc4f5c19e2f5d8159c5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e92d5bc4f5c19e2f5d8159c5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: You've really put in some work! That attention to detail is great."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-50/session_13-b1dac57fc98705fd34bf0eaf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:21:17.370820+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b1dac57fc98705fd34bf0eaf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b1dac57fc98705fd34bf0eaf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Thanks, Calvin! It's all about those small details that make it unique and personalized."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-50/session_13-2c33f38c6d2b75407c9022d1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:21:17.382784+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2c33f38c6d2b75407c9022d1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2c33f38c6d2b75407c9022d1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Yeah, customizing a masterpiece with those small details is what makes it unique and personalized."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-50/session_13-592639380e283d275b69800a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:21:17.394069+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "592639380e283d275b69800a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "592639380e283d275b69800a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Yeah! It's about showing my style, it's like customizing a work of art on wheels."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-50/session_13-6e7e364a762861012419e984", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:21:17.408180+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6e7e364a762861012419e984", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6e7e364a762861012419e984", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: No problem, Dave. Your enthusiasm and hard work show in everything you do. Keep coming up with new cool stuff, bud. I'm excited to see what you'll do next."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-50/session_13-5022d8d0d1df7fa53dcb9420", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:21:17.415169+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5022d8d0d1df7fa53dcb9420", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5022d8d0d1df7fa53dcb9420", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Cheers, Calvin! Really appreciate your help. I'm gonna keep working hard and coming up with new cool stuff. And if you need a hand with your music stuff, just let me know! Check out my awesome music studio setup with a high-quality sound system. You won't believe how amazing your songs sound here!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-50/session_13-a6d00140e65bef1c3904c85b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:21:17.433157+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a6d00140e65bef1c3904c85b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a6d00140e65bef1c3904c85b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Thanks for the offer, Dave. I'm super busy with my music stuff at the moment, so I'll keep it in mind. Great work, dude!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-50/session_13-64360ed51f7cc86181c4e8bd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:21:17.448521+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "64360ed51f7cc86181c4e8bd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "64360ed51f7cc86181c4e8bd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: No worries, Calvin. Got it. Good luck with your music!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-50/session_13-e703c0f99a4f5c2c5977c9b5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:21:17.462275+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e703c0f99a4f5c2c5977c9b5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e703c0f99a4f5c2c5977c9b5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Thanks for the encouragement, Dave. I'll keep working hard and making music. Take care!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-50/session_13-9bd03d387cbd20b06575de15", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:21:17.473827+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9bd03d387cbd20b06575de15", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9bd03d387cbd20b06575de15", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: See ya, Calvin! Stay awesome. Catch ya later."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-50/session_13-19511a639231ce4648cba892", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:21:17.484625+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "19511a639231ce4648cba892", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "19511a639231ce4648cba892", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
